    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/cc227c239161295baea2876404e4e326.avif?t=1755639217\" data-has-big width=800 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a FPS investigative horror game with an engaging and unique story, interesting puzzles, the scenario itself is a puzzle that changes at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a beautiful soundtrack that is unusual for horror games. You will feel peace in hell with this soundtrack. This is a complete game with approximately one and a half to two hours, in the player's first experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/e4ce9768c316bf7f79aa3c94f100a514.poster.avif?t=1755639217\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/e4ce9768c316bf7f79aa3c94f100a514.webm?t=1755639217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/e4ce9768c316bf7f79aa3c94f100a514.mp4?t=1755639217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USA KARAMA:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After one of the biggest corruption scams in the history of humanity, the United States became the headquarters of the largest food company in the world, but this was at the cost of the dignity of thousands of people. Strange things started to happen since then. The karma of hunger, violence and drugs within the United States reached an unbearable level. And, in the midst of all these social problems, China managed to make the quantum processor work for 7.7 minutes, which seems to have caused a collision of space and time, giving way for the souls who lost their happiness due to the corrupt government to materialize in our world and seek revenge. We all have our share of guilt for not uniting to defend ourselves against corruption. Travel through time, know your guilt and redeem yourself. Between men and monsters, learn to point your weapon in the right direction this time. Don't be fooled, the devil's democracy is what we are living in now.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/cc227c239161295baea2876404e4e326.avif?t=1755639217\" data-has-big width=800 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a FPS investigative horror game with an engaging and unique story, interesting puzzles, the scenario itself is a puzzle that changes at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a beautiful soundtrack that is unusual for horror games. You will feel peace in hell with this soundtrack. This is a complete game with approximately one and a half to two hours, in the player's first experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/e4ce9768c316bf7f79aa3c94f100a514.poster.avif?t=1755639217\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/e4ce9768c316bf7f79aa3c94f100a514.webm?t=1755639217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811490/extras/e4ce9768c316bf7f79aa3c94f100a514.mp4?t=1755639217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USA KARAMA:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After one of the biggest corruption scams in the history of humanity, the United States became the headquarters of the largest food company in the world, but this was at the cost of the dignity of thousands of people. Strange things started to happen since then. The karma of hunger, violence and drugs within the United States reached an unbearable level. And, in the midst of all these social problems, China managed to make the quantum processor work for 7.7 minutes, which seems to have caused a collision of space and time, giving way for the souls who lost their happiness due to the corrupt government to materialize in our world and seek revenge. We all have our share of guilt for not uniting to defend ourselves against corruption. Travel through time, know your guilt and redeem yourself. Between men and monsters, learn to point your weapon in the right direction this time. Don't be fooled, the devil's democracy is what we are living in now.</p>",
